{
  "category": "Uncategorized",
  "description": "Implement Stack Size Variation and Density Control System\n\nAdd configurable stack sizing with multiple size options (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6) and implement three density presets that control how stack sizes are distributed and arranged throughout the application.\n\nRequirements:\n- Support 6 discrete stack size values: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 units\n- Implement 3 density presets with specific distribution behaviors:\n  - Density 1: Super dense - prioritize smallest sizes, minimal spacing between elements\n  - Density 3: Medium - balanced distribution with regions of both high density and larger spacing\n  - Density 6: Mixed - vary sizes across multiple levels with maximum diversity and alternation\n- Provide user interface controls for selecting stack size and density preset\n- Persist user's density preference across application sessions\n- Ensure smooth visual transitions when switching between density settings\n- Consider edge cases where density settings conflict with available screen space\n- Test density behaviors at different viewport sizes to ensure responsive behavior",
